WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
Just stop asking so many questions

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:02,400
things are a bit complicated

3
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,200
But Yu Yu is indeed my daughter, and it’s true that she’s fake

4
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:06,280
related by blood

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,160
Why are you so convinced?

6
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,960
If only I had such a lovely daughter

7
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:16,340
How much does it cost to wake up while sleeping?

8
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:19,390
Lao Wang, why are you so slow to buy a public post?

9
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:20,390
Come back quickly to help

10
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,740
What are you urging me to do? Isn’t it coming?

11
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,140
Not active in making money

12
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,380
What are you talking about there?

13
00:00:28,700 --> 00:00:30,700
A person who drives a shabby electricity store and goes there in one day

14
00:00:30,820 --> 00:00:32,300
There are many people who haven’t come to buy breakfast from us yet.

15
00:00:32,500 --> 00:00:35,980
If I were him, I would have found another side. How are you talking?

16
00:00:36,420 --> 00:01:01,980
I just said what's wrong? I told the truth. Is there anything wrong? It's okay. What do I want to eat? Dad will be your uncle.

17
00:01:02,220 --> 00:01:05,640
Do you want to buy something?
